    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a consolation prize for people who can't cut it. i don't want \"quiet mastery\" or a \"varied spectrum.\" i wanted to be the best. now i just look in the mirror and see someone who peaked in high school and is just coasting toward nothing. being a \"competent\" nobody feels more like a slow death than actually living.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
