      "content": "It sounds like your definition of a fulfilling life is heavily tied to external validation and being unmatched, which puts immense pressure on yourself. Allow yourself to grieve the vision of the \"best\" you felt you were supposed to be. True growth isn't always a sharp peak; sometimes it's the persistent, challenging work of becoming a more capable version of yourself every day.",
      "source": "target",
