    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"work\" feels pointless though. what's the point of working hard to just be a slightly better version of a nobody? it just feels like i'm prolonging the inevitable. like, if the ceiling is already set and i'm stuck below it, there's no real way out of this mediocrity. part of me thinks it would be easier to just stop trying altogether. or just stop everything.",
